# Emerald's functional core — seven short tours.
#
#   task examples        # compiles and runs this file (each tour prints its
#                        # own banner, in the order imported below)
#
# Each tour is also a complete program on its own — compile any of them
# directly and it prints its banner and demos:
#
#   ./bin/emeraldc examples/functional/lambdas.rald
#
#   1. first_class.rald   functions are values: stored, passed, returned
#   2. higher_order.rald  map / filter / reduce, and custom HOFs
#   3. lambdas.rald       anonymous functions, contextual typing, thunks
#   4. callbacks.rald     inline callbacks at the call site
#   5. closures.rald      captures, private state, factories
#   6. composition.rald   f >> g, x |> f, pipelines, chained calls
#   7. lazy.rald          thunks, memoization, short-circuiting

